    {"id":"2000000000000005","fromNode":"1000000000000005","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"100000000000001a","toSide":"top","label":"有了数值关系还要核对算法几何"},
    {"id":"2000000000000006","fromNode":"100000000000001a","fromSide":"left","toNode":"1000000000000006","toSide":"top","label":"成对相异度可进入合适的连接规则"},
    {"id":"2000000000000007","fromNode":"100000000000001a","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"100000000000000c","toSide":"top","label":"平方 Euclidean 几何定义 K-means 目标"},
    {"id":"2000000000000008","fromNode":"100000000000001a","fromSide":"right","toNode":"100000000000000f","toSide":"top","label":"同一相异度也定义轮廓评价"},
